---
// MontanhaB2.astro — A Trilha Finitiva dos 5 Portais da Montanha B2
// Padrão Impeccable (Craft Floor) — Linha de Progressão com SVGs Consistentes
---

<section id="portais" class="relative py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <!-- Cabeçalho -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
        A Montanha B2: Um mapa finito de 2.500 Chunks
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300">
        Estruturados nativamente na LEXI Alpha. Aqui não existe "estudar para sempre". São 5 Portais rigorosamente calibrados para levar você da paralisia à autonomia executiva completa em 6 a 8 meses.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Lista dos 5 Portais em Timeline Conectada -->
    <div class="relative space-y-6 before:absolute before:inset-0 before:left-8 sm:before:left-12 before:w-0.5 before:bg-slate-800 before:hidden sm:before:block">
      <!-- Portal 1 -->
      <div class="portal-card relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 sm:p-8 hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <!-- SVG Ícone: Fala Diária / Descongelamento -->
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">Portal 1 • A1 → A2</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 font-medium">350 Chunks</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">O Descongelamento</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Guardião: <strong class="text-slate-200">Jordan</strong> (Amigo de NY). Eliminação imediata do medo de errar, pedidos em restaurantes, rotinas e conversas do dia a dia americano com suporte contínuo.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-500/30 shrink-0">
          Rank E ➔ Rank D
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Portal 2 -->
      <div class="portal-card relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 sm:p-8 hover:border-teal-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-teal-950/80 border border-teal-500/30 text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <!-- SVG Ícone: Viagens / BICS -->
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" />
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-400">Portal 2 • A2 → B1</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 font-medium">+650 Chunks (1.000 total)</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">O Motor do BICS</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Guardião: <strong class="text-slate-200">Miles</strong> (World Explorer). Autonomia de viagem, conexões em aeroportos, histórias no passado e resolução de imprevistos sem recorrer a aplicativos de tradução.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-teal-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-teal-950/40 border border-teal-500/30 shrink-0">
          Rank D ➔ Rank C
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Portal 3 -->
      <div class="portal-card relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 sm:p-8 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-950/80 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <!-- SVG Ícone: Tecnologia / Agilidade Mental -->
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2" />
              <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21" />
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400">Portal 3 • B1 Intermediário</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 font-medium">+500 Chunks (1.500 total)</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">A Ponte da Fluência</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Guardião: <strong class="text-slate-200">Zack</strong> (Dev da Califórnia). Linguagem natural de tecnologia, humor, gírias profissionais, reuniões de daily e argumentação ágil sem hesitação.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-cyan-950/40 border border-cyan-500/30 shrink-0">
          Rank C ➔ Rank B
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Portal 4 -->
      <div class="portal-card relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 sm:p-8 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-950/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <!-- SVG Ícone: Negócios / CALP Executivo -->
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M20 7h-4v-2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z" />
              <path d="M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400">Portal 4 • B1 → B2</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 font-medium">+500 Chunks (2.000 total)</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">O CALP Executivo</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Guardiã: <strong class="text-slate-200">Alexandra</strong> (Executive Coach de Londres). Negociações de alto impacto, apresentações para investidores, relatórios executivos e persuasão refinada.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-500/30 shrink-0">
          Rank B ➔ Rank A
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Portal 5 -->
      <div class="portal-card relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 sm:p-8 hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-950/80 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <!-- SVG Ícone: Cume B2 / Maestria -->
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-400">Portal 5 • B2 Avançado</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 font-medium">+500 Chunks (2.500 total)</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">O Cume da B2</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Guardião: <strong class="text-slate-200">Hayes</strong> (Mestre Acadêmico de Oxford). Debates complexos, improvisação profunda, nuances culturais e preparação para a Boss Raid ao vivo com Gabe Ferreira.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-purple-950/40 border border-purple-500/30 shrink-0">
          Rank A ➔ Rank S (Fluência B2)
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
